OL,3,GNEWSAFormer addict now teaches at hub
OL,4,Athat turned his life around
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former addict who has credited a
OL,7,Frecovery centre with helping him get
OL,8,Fover alcohol dependancy is now helping
OL,9,Fothers by teaching at the same
OL,10,Ffacility.
OL,12,FThe Blackpool Recovery Hub, which
OL,13,Fopened last year, provides practical
OL,14,Fsupport and guidance through
OL,15,Fcounselling and sessions including IT
OL,16,Fand creative activities.
OL,18,FLuke Gribbon is one of many people who
OL,19,Fhave found the hub a lifeline and has
OL,20,Fnow pledged to use his own experiences
OL,21,Fto help others.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
